{"id":23050,"name":"勿忘她的火焰","rarity":5,"path":"Warlock","desc":"虚无命途专属的光锥，光锥技能仅对该命途生效。","story":"<i>「来吧，来到我的身旁……」</i>\\n一缕鲜活的回忆被火焰引着，包裹她的躯体，她的心灵。\\n\\n往昔堕入坟茔，那是真实吗？\\n<i>「嘘，不要啜泣，不要拒绝……」</i>\\n她把自己烙印在他人心间，陌生的眼神逐渐亲切。\\n<i>「想起来了么？」</i>\\n\\n旧忆的余烬悉数散去，脸庞牵惹一丝令人迷醉的花香——\\n<i>「我，就是你的回忆。」</i>","max_promotion":6,"max_rank":5,"skill":{"id":23050,"name":"焚身","desc":"使装备者的击破特攻提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#1[i]%</unbreak></color>。进入战斗时，使装备者和另一位开战的队友造成的击破伤害提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#2[i]%</unbreak></color>，若不存在开战的队友则对装备者和击破特攻最高的队友生效，同类效果无法叠加。装备者为敌方目标添加弱点时，恢复1个战技点，该效果最多触发1次，施放终结技时重置可触发次数。","level":{"1":{"level":1,"param_list":[0.6,0.32]},"2":{"level":2,"param_list":[0.75,0.42]},"3":{"level":3,"param_list":[0.9,0.52]},"4":{"level":4,"param_list":[1.05,0.62]},"5":{"level":5,"param_list":[1.2,0.72]}}},"stats":{"0":{"hp_base":52.8,"hp_add":7.92,"attack_base":24,"attack_add":3.6,"defence_base":21,"defence_add":3.15,"max_level":20,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":5000},{"ItemID":114011,"ItemNum":8}]},"1":{"hp_base":116.16,"hp_add":7.92,"attack_base":52.8,"attack_add":3.6,"defence_base":46.2,"defence_add":3.15,"max_level":30,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":10000},{"ItemID":110221,"ItemNum":4},{"ItemID":114011,"ItemNum":12}]},"2":{"hp_base":200.64,"hp_add":7.92,"attack_base":91.2,"attack_add":3.6,"defence_base":79.8,"defence_add":3.15,"max_level":40,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":20000},{"ItemID":110222,"ItemNum":4},{"ItemID":114012,"ItemNum":8}]},"3":{"hp_base":285.12,"hp_add":7.92,"attack_base":129.6,"attack_add":3.6,"defence_base":113.4,"defence_add":3.15,"max_level":50,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":50000},{"ItemID":110222,"ItemNum":8},{"ItemID":114012,"ItemNum":12}]},"4":{"hp_base":369.6,"hp_add":7.92,"attack_base":168,"attack_add":3.6,"defence_base":147,"defence_add":3.15,"max_level":60,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":100000},{"ItemID":110223,"ItemNum":5},{"ItemID":114013,"ItemNum":6}]},"5":{"hp_base":454.08,"hp_add":7.92,"attack_base":206.4,"attack_add":3.6,"defence_base":180.6,"defence_add